      "question": "In which system or location does the specification document live, and how does the engineer access the version that needs to be reviewed?",
      "answer": "The specification document lives in a document repository. The reviewer accesses it from there, along with the previous document version and the feature change list. No further detail about access method or authentication is specified."
    },
    {
      "question_id": "Q3",
